%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c0dc09dbaa30e694681d8e3582c8800f, type: 3}
  m_Name: DIa_King_CrimeRateLoweredSuddenly
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Crime rate lowered suddenly
  speakingCharacters:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a6f24257be70fb4faf4193faac70975, type: 2}
    dialogueLines:
    - line: 'I wanted to update you on the crimes - putting the new recruits to work
        almost completely diminished the recent surge in crimes. '
      choices: []
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: 'While I am happy about that part, I find it also very unusual. Frankly,
        I do not trust this sudden calm. Further, the amount of eager new recruits
        also reduced, so our army growth will slow down again for a bit. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: I agree, that is weird. Put some trusted men together and investigate
          further.
        responseToChoice: 'Yeah, I was thinking of that too, I will get right to
          it. '
        consequences:
        - type: 0
          amount: -25
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 2
          amount: -5
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 348265b9d2a2f1649b13e6c7c66b75f5, type: 2}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'That is uncommon, I agree. Let''s prepare for a storm and hire
          more guards if you can - make it lucrative. '
        responseToChoice: 'Sure, can''t hurt to increase our numbers. '
        consequences:
        - type: 0
          amount: -250
        - type: 1
          amount: 10
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 2
          amount: -2
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed5f73b0effa9944f9740045f2345268, type: 2}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: If the crime rate lowered, that is good. We have our resources
          elswhere to put to use - let's call this done.
        responseToChoice: 'I feel something is off, but I will follow your advice. '
        consequences: []
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 2
          amount: -5
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed5f73b0effa9944f9740045f2345268, type: 2}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: 'Let''s hope there is not a storm brewing on the horizon. I will check
        in with you again if there should be news. '
      choices: []
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
